          "text": "Random seed policy: any task-local stochastic algorithm will use seed 1701 and be recorded. If a library/model cannot accept a fixed seed, that will be recorded as not fixable rather than fabricated as deterministic. No random-number method is currently required for the geometry-preparation stage."
